{{> Logo this}}

{{> EmailTitle title="Wrong two factor codes were entered for your account." }}

{{!--
  What the last wrong code's sign-in began with
  (AuthenticationEmail.sendTwoFactorWrongCodesEmail). It decides what the owner
  should do: a new password shuts out whoever holds the old one, but somebody
  reading the mailbox can ask for another link, so they are told to secure the
  mailbox first.
--}}
{{#ifCond isMagicLinkSignIn "true"}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(concat "Someone opened a sign-in link emailed to you for your " (brandNameHtml) " account, then entered wrong codes at the second step of signing in.")}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(concat "Someone entered the password of your " (brandNameHtml) " account, then entered wrong codes at the second step of signing in.")}}
{{/ifCond}}

{{> InfoBlock info="To keep your account safe, each next code now waits before it is checked: one minute at first, then longer after each wrong code, up to an hour."}}

{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Wrong codes in a row:" plainText=wrongCodeCount }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Last wrong code at:" plainText=enteredAt }}
{{> RequestOriginFields this }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}

{{> InfoBlock info="<strong>If this was you</strong>, check that your phone sets its clock automatically, then try again when the wait is over. A backup code or a security key also signs you in."}}

{{#ifCond isMagicLinkSignIn "true"}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(concat "<strong>If this was not you</strong>, someone can read your email. First, change your email account's password and remove any forwarding you did not set up: a new " (brandNameHtml) " password alone does not stop them asking for another link. Then reset your " (brandNameHtml) " password: any link already sent stops working, and the wait ends for you.")}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info="<strong>If this was not you</strong>, someone knows your password. Reset it now: the old password stops working, and the wait ends for you."}}
{{/ifCond}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonText="Reset your password" buttonUrl=forgotPasswordUrl }}

